# name:dir:script[:needs[:pre]]  dir is relative to the prepared tree (mksp.py), script runs there; a suite is green when it exits 0.
# pre = the suite runs in the world before the v3 catalogue switch (run_all.sh, suites/shim/sitecustomize.py): the older suites use the six legacy styles, which
#       the switch retired, as the vehicle of what they guard (payments, chain, refunds, admin, markets, price tests, texts); the v3 suites run in the real world.
# needs = fixtures: the private image fixtures (suites/private/fixtures, never in git); skipped (exit 77) when they are missing.
# New suites of the v3 work (suites/README.md, section "Adding a suite") are appended at the end, with the same format:
#   v3reg:scripts/styles_tests:test_registry.py          (a suite in the repository itself, copied from REPO_DIRS by mksp.py)
# The lines at the end are those suites: v3wp0 (the probe, the pins, this folder, the bundle report), v3reg (WP1: the style registry, the
# catalogue, the price class, the build check), v3gate (WP3: the eye profile, the restoration gate, eye_id and seal v2; set
# SNAPEYES_CALIB and SNAPEYES_GATE_TABLE to also replay the calibration set, reported as LOCAL lines), v3single (WP5A: the singles family
# replayed against the scratch prototype's own pictures; set SNAPEYES_SCRATCH_Y3 (the wave-y3 folder) for the 4096 px pictures of the plate styles and the
# check of the port's edits, SNAPEYES_CALIB for the real calibration eyes: LOCAL lines, not counted), v3steps (WP6a: the master plan, its steps and
# state machine, the guards, the one duration constant, the watchdog, the admin actions and the clean-up of the style folder, over HTTP with a stub for the
# image model; about two minutes).
# v3cutover (WP18: the catalogue switch, in the REAL world: the table of ceilings, the registry's effective default and the pages' reading of it, nothing orderable before the owner's
# tick, the tick, the rollback, the retired legacy ids and a session that crosses the cutover, the tile images, the AI-made material sentence and one LEGAL_UPDATED, health and prices;
# set SNAPEYES_CALIB to also check that the committed tile images are what scripts/make_style_tiles.py makes of the owner's eyes: a LOCAL line, not counted; about 15 seconds).
# The entries that end in :pre run in the world before the switch (suites/README.md, The two worlds).
